ulation of this application does not guarantee the design, size, range of motion, etc. of the actual robot.\nWhen actually installing a robot, please check the specifications on the product page.\n- Please be careful of your surroundings when using this app.", "short_description": "You can place OVR series virtual robots in real space and simulate operation.\nThe OVR series is a robot sold by Oriental Motor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1594860848028062", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210390_1594860854694728_1273340538204967659_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L9mlALTlCwYQ7kNvwE3a6Iz&_nc_oc=AdoKmrSgLjhvfAbA0BbtbccaDOWRz7GIxAvh6LbLMOtUM3ESseAZ-f1lpbPUcrnYF3Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSsuDUADftBSlVHg8ywslw-UdNz2wdDMGitZwYfEz0QoQ&oe=6B0844D6"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscapeMini.png", "id": "858590429630683", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_858590432964016_3799015126354441121_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QaqN7MgcOD4Q7kNvwHQnWH9&_nc_oc=AdpfuOM3kUvollo5U8AIwNvdVx6sOdz-JGC0LX6ekS1HkU_dQX7GVvmnhrlSeApDSwo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR2VqKpF-3JrRx3r0jbF9ZkmQLNSHKahnxBdZhcR6dvtw&oe=6B08485C"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "495376463065176", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_495376466398509_7417159219708782199_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NCgb-Hap3mYQ7kNvwHFCZhU&_nc_oc=Adrt5kxGtxoDGO63bQWM2p50V9Q4tQ2-UumiYCmvKFeYge66aN-ouxqsBPeAasCa4zE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQStVq2Y6T0ha0AwhccbVAJIcU5A5jSotUYh3urWhemB0w&oe=6B0861DB"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "486